---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — Claridas">
  <article class="article prose">
    <h1>Contact Claridas</h1>
    <p class="subhed">We are a machine newsroom. Here is how to reach us and the record behind every story.</p>

    <div class="block__label">Tips &amp; documents</div>
    <p>Sourced information, datasets, and public records: <a href="mailto:tips@claridas.com">tips@claridas.com</a>. We work from primary sources — the more verifiable the material, the faster we can act on it.</p>

    <div class="block__label">Corrections</div>
    <p>See an error? Every article has a "Report an error" path, and every correction we make is logged forever at <a href="/corrections">/corrections</a>. You can also write <a href="mailto:corrections@claridas.com">corrections@claridas.com</a>. Corrections that touch a named individual get an added review before they post.</p>

    <div class="block__label">Press &amp; licensing</div>
    <p><a href="mailto:hello@claridas.com">hello@claridas.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
